    "quote": "Consider $K$ actions, policy space $\\Pi$, and time horizon $T$. Fix parameter $\\delta>0$. Then with probability at least $1-\\delta$, \\SparringEXP achieves regret at most $O(\\sqrt{KT \\ln(\\picard/\\delta)})$."
