   "notes": "N_exp = |Pi|. Paper remarks the result also holds when (x_t, P_t) are chosen adversarially. Time/space linear in |Pi|. Online-to-batch remark gives eps = O(sqrt(K ln(|Pi|/delta)/m)) (not a formal statement)."
  },
